--- Asymmetric signing resolves a top-level key-set operation handle.
search [1] in COMPLETION-TEST :
  asymSignDigest(handleId(1, testTa), repeatDigestByte(randomData, 32), testTa)
  < taOid(1, testTa) : CryptoOperation |
